{"aliases":["VLA","Vision-Language-Action Model","视觉语言动作模型"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"expand: multimodal and embodied","op":"insert","reason":"跨模态对齐解决表示是否可比。视觉语言动作模型解决的是把低层控制写进词表，只是名字里都有 vision-language。","run_id":"r_20261022_pvwcb8"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261022_pvwcb8","expanded_at":null,"how":"连续动作按维均匀离散，映射到词表里的符号，解码时再还原成控制量。","id":"n_01m5gp43gke4n0cc4g","importance":5,"kind":"concept","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Vision-Language-Action Model","name_zh":"视觉语言动作模型","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.513351+00:00","slug":"vision-language-action-model","status":"active","summary":"把视觉、语言和机器人动作放进同一个词元接口的模型。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261022_pvwcb8","what":"输入相机图像和文字指令，输出被写成文本词元的低层动作，而不是只生成高层计划。","why":"视觉语言模型会看、会说，但不会直接控制关节。高层规划再交给单独的控制器，语义知识就进不了低层动作。把动作收成同一套词元后，网页上预训练的模型才能直接闭环控制。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.85,"created_at":"2026-11-10T08:37:57.936139+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m729pppkeztpa19b","other_id":"n_01m729ppkv48djvf60","other_kind":"application","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Robotic Manipulation","other_name_zh":"机器人操作","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"robotic-manipulation","other_summary":"让机器人用夹爪或灵巧手抓取、移动和改变物体状态的任务。","rationale":"大规模 VLA 预训练被当作机器人操作策略的基础，再按任务微调。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Wall-OSS-0.5 Technical Report","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.30877"}],"type":"applied_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.7,"created_at":"2026-11-09T04:15:50.605137+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m6z8a0zpb6vka2bt","other_id":"n_01m6z8a0x3zpvk1mz9","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Vision-Language Model","other_name_zh":"视觉语言模型","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"vision-language-model","other_summary":"同时接收图像（或视频）和文本、在两种模态间对齐与推理的模型。","rationale":"VLA 在视觉语言模型的感知和语言理解之上增加动作输出。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Vision-Language Models for Vision Tasks: A Survey","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.00685"}],"type":"builds_on","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5gp43jzfevrcdsq","other_id":"n_01m5gp43gke2xreyc3","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Action Tokenization","other_name_zh":"动作词元化","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"action-tokenization","other_summary":"把连续控制量离散成语言模型词表里的符号。","rationale":"低层动作写进词表之后，视觉语言模型才能直接输出可执行控制，而不只是文字计划。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"RT-2: Vision-Language-Action Models Transfer Web Knowledge to Robotic Control","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.15818"}],"type":"enables","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:49:34.000423+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5gr73p5n8hekqhq","other_id":"n_01m5gr73ktdq4rpn8h","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"OpenVLA","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"openvla","other_summary":"把开放的视觉语言模型微调成输出离散动作词元的机器人策略。","rationale":"输入图像和语言指令，直接预测机器人动作 token，而不是只做高层规划。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"OpenVLA: An Open-Source Vision-Language-Action Model","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.09246"}],"type":"is_a","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:12:58.450922+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5gp43k2t6xr1cgm","other_id":"n_01m5gp43gk3t4vzrgj","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"RT-2","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"rt-2","other_summary":"把视觉语言模型协同微调成直接输出低层动作的模型。","rationale":"RT-2 把这一类模型定义为动作和自然语言共用文本词元，并给出了直接闭环控制的实例。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"RT-2: Vision-Language-Action Models Transfer Web Knowledge to Robotic Control","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.15818"}],"type":"is_a","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-10T08:37:57.936139+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m729pppcswh1nas2","other_id":"n_01m729ppkvw9e4d88p","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"WALL-OSS","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"wall-oss","other_summary":"在视觉语言模型主干上加动作生成部件、跨 20 多种机器人本体预训练的开源 VLA 模型。","rationale":"技术报告把它定义为基于视觉语言模型主干、带动作生成组件的开源 VLA。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Wall-OSS-0.5 Technical Report","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.30877"}],"type":"is_a","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null},{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-10-22T02:49:34.000423+00:00","dir":"in","id":"e_01m5gr73pkqpe78hw9","other_id":"n_01m5gr73kt277m970r","other_kind":"model","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"pi0","other_name_zh":null,"other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"pi0","other_summary":"用视觉语言模型加动作专家，以流匹配生成连续动作块的策略。","rationale":"它在预训练视觉语言模型上继续训练，直接输出机器人动作，因此属于视觉语言动作模型。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"π0: A Vision-Language-Action Flow Model for General Robot Control","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.24164"}],"type":"is_a","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2023-07-28","publisher":"arXiv","quote":"we express the actions as text tokens and incorporate them directly into the training set of the model in the same way as natural language tokens.","title":"RT-2: Vision-Language-Action Models Transfer Web Knowledge to Robotic Control","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.15818"}],"topics":[{"id":"n_01m5gp43gkpmd7terp","name":"Embodied AI","name_zh":"具身智能","slug":"embodied-ai"},{"id":"n_01m5gnvyxxtm87zzr0","name":"Multimodal Models","name_zh":"多模态模型","slug":"multimodal-models"}],"updates":[]}